  "body": "**Blocked by:** #166\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #166; #168 is the next sequential slice of the `observability` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd `AsyncLocalStorage` trace context. Mint UUID `traceId` at HTTP/WS entry, scheduler ticks, new agent runs, and mail-sync cycles. Bind agentRunId, job name/id, and mailbox id when available. Define one zod queue envelope: `enqueueJob` auto-stamps the active trace and `registerTask` restores it; public job callers cannot provide it. Forward it as `x-trace-id` to the AI gateway and log it beside agent_run_id.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, automated tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No OpenTelemetry collector or distributed tracing stack.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- One cross-process flow retains one traceId.\n- Every entry point creates a valid UUID.\n- Public producers cannot omit or spoof the queue trace.\n- Concurrent contexts remain isolated.\n",
